#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:15
msgid "Discover Revisions features and choices"
msgstr "Temukan fitur dan pilihan Revisions"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:15
msgid ""
"Discover separate native revision, archive and duplication post types and "
"fields, revision statuses and active Pro/integration state. Supply post_id "
"for source permissions, available templates and taxonomy assignment "
"choices. Revisions are separate from the published source post. Native "
"capabilities and source read access are enforced."
msgstr ""
"Temukan tipe dan bidang post revisi, arsip, dan duplikasi native yang "
"terpisah, status revisi, dan keadaan aktif Pro/integrasi. Berikan post_id "
"untuk izin sumber, template yang tersedia, dan pilihan penugasan taksonomi. "
"Revisi terpisah dari post sumber yang diterbitkan. Kapasitas native dan "
"akses baca sumber ditegakkan."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:16
msgid "Find revisions and past revisions"
msgstr "Temukan revisi dan revisi sebelumnya"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:16
msgid ""
"Browse a bounded native revision queue or WordPress archive. Filter by "
"source post, status, author or title. Every returned revision and source "
"requires native read access. Other users’ restricted revisions are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Jelajahi antrean revisi native yang dibatasi atau arsip WordPress. Filter "
"berdasarkan post sumber, status, penulis, atau judul. Setiap revisi dan "
"sumber yang dikembalikan memerlukan akses baca native. Revisi terbatas dari "
"pengguna lain dikecualikan."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:17
msgid "Read a revision source post"
msgstr "Baca post sumber revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:17
msgid ""
"Read one supported revision, archive or duplication source and its revision "
"token before creating a new copy. Requires source read access and native "
"copy_post or edit_post. Does not expose passwords, authentication metadata "
"or signed preview links."
msgstr ""
"Baca satu revisi yang didukung, arsip atau sumber duplikasi dan token "
"revisinya sebelum membuat salinan baru. Memerlukan akses baca sumber dan "
"copy_post atau edit_post native. Tidak mengekspos kata sandi, metadata "
"autentikasi, atau tautan pratayang yang ditandatangani."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:18
msgid "Read a revision"
msgstr "Baca revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:18
msgid ""
"Read revision content, its native scheduling dates and terms, plus "
"revisions for both the copy and source. Authentication metadata, passwords "
"and signed preview links are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Baca konten revisi, tanggal penjadwalan native dan istilahnya, serta revisi "
"untuk salinan dan sumber. Metadata autentikasi, kata sandi, dan tautan "
"pratayang yang ditandatangani dikecualikan."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:20
msgid "Create a new revision"
msgstr "Buat revisi baru"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:20
msgid ""
"Create a native unsubmitted revision of one supported readable source using "
"copy_post permission and the source expected_hash. Native metadata/taxonomy "
"cloning, revision limits, builder gates and hooks apply. Omit changes to "
"copy content unchanged. dry_run never creates a copy."
msgstr ""
"Buat revisi native yang belum dikirim dari satu sumber yang dapat dibaca "
"menggunakan izin copy_post dan expected_hash sumber. Kloning "
"metadata/taksonomi native, batasan revisi, gerbang pembangun, dan hook "
"diterapkan. Hilangkan perubahan untuk menjaga konten salinan tetap tidak "
"berubah. dry_run tidak pernah membuat salinan."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:21
msgid "Duplicate a source post"
msgstr "Duplikat post sumber"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:21
msgid ""
"Create a native draft duplicate of an enabled readable source post. "
"Requires duplicate_post permission, the source expected_hash and native "
"duplication settings. Copies the native configured fields, taxonomy and "
"metadata through RevisionCreation. dry_run creates nothing."
msgstr ""
"Buat duplikat draf native dari post sumber yang dapat dibaca dan "
"diaktifkan. Memerlukan izin duplicate_post, expected_hash sumber, dan "
"pengaturan duplikasi native. Menyalin bidang yang dikonfigurasi native, "
"taksonomi, dan metadata melalui RevisionCreation. dry_run tidak membuat "
"apa-apa."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:22
msgid "Update revision content"
msgstr "Perbarui konten revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:22
msgid ""
"Patch only supplied editable revision fields using expected_hash. Native "
"allowed fields, locks, term/author permissions and sanitizers apply. The "
"published source is unchanged. Submitted or scheduled copies require their "
"native edit permission; all edits to scheduled revisions require approval "
"permission. dry_run validates without saving."
msgstr ""
"Patch hanya bidang revisi yang dapat diedit yang disediakan menggunakan "
"expected_hash. Bidang, kunci, izin istilah/penulis dan sanitizers yang "
"diizinkan native diterapkan. Sumber yang diterbitkan tidak berubah. Salinan "
"yang dikirim atau dijadwalkan memerlukan izin edit native mereka; semua "
"edit untuk revisi yang dijadwalkan memerlukan izin persetujuan. dry_run "
"memvalidasi tanpa menyimpan."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:24
msgid "Submit, approve or manage revisions"
msgstr "Kirim, setujui atau kelola revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:24
msgid ""
"Apply one native action to up to 50 explicit revision IDs: submit, decline, "
"approve, publish a scheduled revision now, unschedule, trash, restore "
"archive or delete an archived revision. Publishing/restoring requires "
"parent_hash and native source edit and approval permissions. All targets "
"are validated before writes; partial failures report confirmed IDs. "
"Approval honors the saved date, scheduling future changes. dry_run never "
"publishes or sends notifications."
msgstr ""
"Terapkan satu tindakan native pada hingga 50 ID revisi eksplisit: kirim, "
"tolak, setujui, terbitkan revisi yang dijadwalkan sekarang, batalkan "
"jadwal, sampah, pulihkan arsip atau hapus revisi yang diarsipkan. "
"Menerbitkan/pulihkan memerlukan parent_hash dan izin edit serta persetujuan "
"sumber native. Semua target divalidasi sebelum penulisan; kegagalan "
"sebagian melaporkan ID yang terkonfirmasi. Persetujuan menghormati tanggal "
"yang disimpan, penjadwalan perubahan di masa depan. dry_run tidak pernah "
"menerbitkan atau mengirim notifikasi."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:25
msgid "Compare revision content"
msgstr "Bandingkan konten revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:25
msgid ""
"Compare standard fields and taxonomy assignments with the readable source, "
"or supply compare_to to compare two authorized revisions of the same "
"source. Missing historical fields are omitted, not treated as cleared. "
"Returns plain source/revision values, not executable previews or signed "
"URLs. Pro metadata providers are discovered separately; credentials are "
"never exported."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan bidang standar dan penugasan taksonomi dengan sumber yang dapat "
"dibaca, atau berikan compare_to untuk membandingkan dua revisi yang "
"diizinkan dari sumber yang sama. Bidang historis yang hilang diabaikan, "
"tidak diperlakukan sebagai dibersihkan. Mengembalikan nilai sumber/revisi "
"biasa, bukan pratayang yang dapat dieksekusi atau URL yang ditandatangani. "
"Penyedia metadata Pro ditemukan secara terpisah; kredensial tidak pernah "
"diekspor."

