#: includes/Mcp/Settings.php:14
msgid "Read Revisions settings"
msgstr "Baca pengaturan Revisions"

#: includes/Mcp/Settings.php:14
msgid ""
"Read native setting identifiers, exact JSON types, defaults, choices, "
"storage and revision. Network-controlled settings require actual network "
"permission to change. Credentials and database maintenance are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Baca pengidentifikasi pengaturan native, tipe JSON yang tepat, default, "
"pilihan, penyimpanan, dan revisi. Pengaturan yang dikendalikan jaringan "
"memerlukan izin jaringan yang sebenarnya untuk diubah. Kredensial dan "
"pemeliharaan basis data dikecualikan."

#: includes/Mcp/Settings.php:15
msgid "Update Revisions settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan Revisi"

#: includes/Mcp/Settings.php:15
msgid ""
"Patch discovered settings only, using expected_hash. JSON booleans are not "
"strings. Native sanitizers, network scope and edition/dependency gates "
"apply. Omitted values remain. dry_run validates without saving or "
"converting revision storage."
msgstr ""
"Hanya mengatur pengaturan yang ditemukan, menggunakan expected_hash. "
"Boolean JSON bukanlah string. Sanitizer asli, jangkauan jaringan, dan "
"gerbang edisi/dependensi berlaku. Nilai yang diabaikan tetap ada. dry_run "
"memvalidasi tanpa menyimpan atau mengonversi penyimpanan revisi."

#: includes/Mcp/Settings.php:155
msgid "Settings changed. Read them again."
msgstr "Pengaturan telah diubah. Baca kembali."

